{"324760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monster Truck Destruction", "steam_appid": 324760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/bcea43a938487a62e09723e93c06ed27.avif?t=1778468088\" width=601 height=160 /></span><br><strong>DRIVE, DESTROY, AND CREATE YOUR WAY TO GLORY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowd is louder than ever—and they want total destruction. Monster Truck Destruction returns with massive new features and improvements that take the chaos to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/af597f9fd1e2e4dde2c676db240e7a78.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD THE MAYHEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the all-new Level Editor mode and unleash your creativity using 700+ props. You can share your creations and challenge yourself with community-created maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/1c0717086b0ccbc49e1304d06c15c527.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A MONSTER LINEUP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garage with 120 new trucks, and browse them all in the new Truck Collection menu. From Bigfoot trucks to customized trucks, everything is within your grasp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/89a7555715da4dd550729934d6215cb7.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REALISTIC TRUCKIN’, REAL DESTRUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience improved physics where trucks bounce, drift, and grip like never before. Smash through obstacles with a dynamic damage system that makes every crash feel powerful and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/d267f74792a714308b6ed555790ac8b4.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR TRUCK</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and personalize your trucks with Customization Upgrades. Players can modify truck part colors or adding flags at rear, to having neon lights or adjusting truck suspension. Make your monster truck look unique!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/6c349eb06157fa1f226b567ae6f0b71f.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW GAME MODES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the new game modes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Floor is Lava: Reach the finish line on time without falling through the lava.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer: Multiplayer lobbies! Players can now hop on with their friends and prove who's the best driver of them all!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling and destructive monster truck gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic truck physics and dynamic damage system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ monster trucks to choose from with a full Truck Collection system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor with 700+ props and playable community maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your trucks as your competition gets harder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: Freestyle, Drag, Side by Side, Championships, Multiplayer, and Floor is Lava.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on real life tracks as created by the Monster X Tour crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization Upgrades to personalize your trucks with flags, neon lights, part color modifications.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/bcea43a938487a62e09723e93c06ed27.avif?t=1778468088\" width=601 height=160 /></span><br><strong>DRIVE, DESTROY, AND CREATE YOUR WAY TO GLORY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowd is louder than ever—and they want total destruction. Monster Truck Destruction returns with massive new features and improvements that take the chaos to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/af597f9fd1e2e4dde2c676db240e7a78.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD THE MAYHEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the all-new Level Editor mode and unleash your creativity using 700+ props. You can share your creations and challenge yourself with community-created maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/1c0717086b0ccbc49e1304d06c15c527.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A MONSTER LINEUP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garage with 120 new trucks, and browse them all in the new Truck Collection menu. From Bigfoot trucks to customized trucks, everything is within your grasp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/89a7555715da4dd550729934d6215cb7.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REALISTIC TRUCKIN’, REAL DESTRUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience improved physics where trucks bounce, drift, and grip like never before. Smash through obstacles with a dynamic damage system that makes every crash feel powerful and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/d267f74792a714308b6ed555790ac8b4.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR TRUCK</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and personalize your trucks with Customization Upgrades. Players can modify truck part colors or adding flags at rear, to having neon lights or adjusting truck suspension. Make your monster truck look unique!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/extras/6c349eb06157fa1f226b567ae6f0b71f.avif?t=1778468088\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW GAME MODES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the new game modes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Floor is Lava: Reach the finish line on time without falling through the lava.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer: Multiplayer lobbies! Players can now hop on with their friends and prove who's the best driver of them all!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling and destructive monster truck gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic truck physics and dynamic damage system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ monster trucks to choose from with a full Truck Collection system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor with 700+ props and playable community maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your trucks as your competition gets harder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: Freestyle, Drag, Side by Side, Championships, Multiplayer, and Floor is Lava.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on real life tracks as created by the Monster X Tour crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization Upgrades to personalize your trucks with flags, neon lights, part color modifications.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Can you handle 1600HP of pure monster truck chaos? Crush cars, soar through massive jumps, and build your own tracks in Monster Truck Destruction—now bigger than ever with new trucks, modes, and multiplayer mayhem!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/252864033c2ff0aa2c0880c110ac3bdd54185fc2/header.jpg?t=1778468088", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/ab4b435c86c520290c26f34d8f027265ebee303c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778468088", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324760/ab4b435c86c520290c26f34d8f027265ebee303c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778468088", "website": "http://www.oddgames.com.au/games/monstertruckdestruction/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 (4 * 3300) or equivalent / AMD FX-9590 (8 * 4700) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (4096 MB) / Radeon RX 570 (8192 MB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700K (8 * 3600 / 4 * 2700) or equivalent / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D (8 * 3400) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3080 Ti (12288 MB) / Radeon RX 6950 XT (16384 MB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz processor or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 MB RAM required<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 450 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 (or similar modern Linux distro)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 / Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 570 (6GB VRAM) / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB VRAM) (Requires Vulkan support)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 (or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 3700X / Intel Core i7-9700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 6700 (8GB VRAM) / NVIDIA RTX 3060 (8GB VRAM) (Requires Vulkan support)<br></li><